        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Assignment to the classification of Psychiatric Technician shall be based on (a) submission of proof that the employee has satisfied the current requirements for Psychiatric Technician as prescribed by the Board of Vocational Nurses and Psychiatric Technician Examiners, and (b) assignment by the Employer of the employee to the classification of Psychiatric Technician in a recognized Psychiatric Unit. The classification of Psychiatric Technician does not preclude the employment of other nursing personnel in the Psychiatric Unit.",
